{"cid":"hr-001","name_local":null,"aliases":["Hive","The Hive Climbing & Yoga"],"chain":null,"address":"Slavonska avenija 16, 10000 Zagreb","website":"https://hivebouldering.com/en","notes":null,"photo":null,"name":"The Hive Zagreb","state":"ZAGREB","suburb":"Zagreb","lat":45.7959714,"lng":16.023592,"coord_source":{"source":"OSM","method":"osm","ref":"way/1221118221"},"coord_precision":"building","types":["indoor-bouldering"],"category":"commercial-gym","status_claim":"open","bouldering":"yes","evidence":[{"source":"HIVE","url":"https://hivebouldering.com/en","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","open","bouldering","address","name"]},{"source":"HIVE","url":"https://hivebouldering.com/en/nasa-dvorana","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","bouldering"]},{"source":"OSM","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1221118221","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["location"]}],"research_notes":"Large bouldering hall with a small lead wall; site states daily opening hours and 170+ boulders. The site's own Google Maps pin (45.79614, 16.02382) agrees with the OSM building. Older directories list a former address at Heinzelova 66 (likely the pre-move site).","country":"HR"}
{"cid":"hr-002","name_local":null,"aliases":["Boulder zona","ArtRock","SPK ArtRock","Bolderana d.o.o."],"chain":null,"address":"Slavenskoga ulica 1, Shopping Centar Precko (rooftop), 10000 Zagreb","website":"https://boulder-zona.com/en/","notes":null,"photo":null,"name":"Boulder Zona","state":"ZAGREB","suburb":"Zagreb","lat":45.7958918,"lng":15.9002847,"coord_source":{"source":"ZONA","method":"official-map","ref":"https://boulder-zona.com/en/contact/ (linked Google Maps place pin)"},"coord_precision":"building","types":["indoor-bouldering"],"category":"commercial-gym","status_claim":"open","bouldering":"yes","evidence":[{"source":"ZONA","url":"https://boulder-zona.com/en/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","open","bouldering","name"]},{"source":"ZONA","url":"https://boulder-zona.com/en/contact/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["address","location"]},{"source":"HSPS","url":"https://hsps-climbing.org/dvorane/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","bouldering","address"]}],"research_notes":"1500 m2 bouldering gym on the roof of Precko shopping centre with moon/kilter/spray boards, courses and booking system. The federation lists a club called ArtRock at the identical address, apparently the same venue under the club name. Coordinates are the place pin linked from the gym's contact page.","country":"HR"}
{"cid":"hr-003","name_local":null,"aliases":["Fothia Velesajam","Fothia 1","SPK Fothia","Fothia"],"chain":null,"address":"Avenija Dubrovnik 15, Pavilion 25 (gallery), Zagreb Fair, 10000 Zagreb","website":"https://fothia.hr/en/","notes":null,"photo":null,"name":"Fothia Zagreb Fair (Velesajam)","state":"ZAGREB","suburb":"Zagreb","lat":45.7801721,"lng":15.9685279,"coord_source":{"source":"OSM","method":"osm","ref":"way/237011161"},"coord_precision":"building","types":["indoor-bouldering"],"category":"commercial-gym","status_claim":"open","bouldering":"yes","evidence":[{"source":"FOTHIA","url":"https://fothia.hr/en/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","open","bouldering","name"]},{"source":"FOTHIA","url":"https://fothia.hr/en/gyms-climbing-fees-fothia-zagreb-fair-bouldering-gym-fothia-velika-gorica-bouldering-gym/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["address","open","bouldering"]},{"source":"HSPS","url":"https://hsps-climbing.org/dvorane/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","bouldering","address"]},{"source":"OSM","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/237011161","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["location"]}],"research_notes":"Club-run gym billed as the country's biggest bouldering gym; public day passes and memberships with published opening hours. Same operator also has a Velika Gorica gym and a Sljeme cable-car hall (see unlocated.md). An older Fothia West hall at Skorpikova 11 is no longer listed on the operator's site.","country":"HR"}
{"cid":"hr-004","name_local":null,"aliases":["BoldeRi.hr","Bolderi Matulji","SPK Bolderi"],"chain":null,"address":"Popovicev put 2d, 51211 Matulji","website":"https://www.bolderi.hr/","notes":null,"photo":null,"name":"BoldeRi","state":"PRIMORJE_GORSKI_KOTAR","suburb":"Matulji","lat":45.3673637,"lng":14.3296289,"coord_source":{"source":"BOLDERI","method":"official-map","ref":"https://www.bolderi.hr/contact-us/ (embedded Google map centred on the address)"},"coord_precision":"building","types":["indoor-bouldering"],"category":"commercial-gym","status_claim":"open","bouldering":"yes","evidence":[{"source":"BOLDERI","url":"https://www.bolderi.hr/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","bouldering","name"]},{"source":"BOLDERI","url":"https://www.bolderi.hr/contact-us/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["address","location","bouldering"]},{"source":"BOLDERI","url":"https://www.bolderi.hr/pricing/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["open"]}],"research_notes":"New boulder hall of roughly 600 m2 between Rijeka and Opatija with courses, cafe and kids area; the site markets it as being in Opatija/Istria but the address is in Matulji. Coordinates come from the map embedded on the contact page (centre of the embed).","country":"HR"}
{"cid":"hr-005","name_local":null,"aliases":["Lapis","SPK Lapis Split","Boulder dvorana Dom mladih"],"chain":null,"address":"Ulica slobode 28 (Dom mladih), 21000 Split","website":"https://spk-lapis.hr/","notes":null,"photo":null,"name":"SPK Lapis (Dom mladih boulder hall)","state":"SPLITSKO_DALMATINSKA","suburb":"Split","lat":43.5123868,"lng":16.4476002,"coord_source":{"source":"LAPIS","method":"official-map","ref":"https://spk-lapis.hr/kontakt/ (embedded Google map, place SPK Lapis)"},"coord_precision":"building","types":["indoor-bouldering"],"category":"club","status_claim":"open","bouldering":"yes","evidence":[{"source":"LAPIS","url":"https://spk-lapis.hr/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","bouldering","name"]},{"source":"LAPIS","url":"https://spk-lapis.hr/kontakt/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["address","location","open"]},{"source":"LAPIS","url":"https://spk-lapis.hr/boulder-galerija/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["bouldering"]},{"source":"DOMMLADIH","url":"https://dom-mladih.org/category/prostori/boulder-dvorana/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","bouldering"]}],"research_notes":"Club hall inside Dom mladih with a boulder hall plus a big rope wall (about 500 m2 of wall in total); weekday evening hours posted, rec climbing for adults offered. Entry is via club membership or arrangement, hence category club. Site footer is dated 2021, so recent activity is only indirectly confirmed.","country":"HR"}
{"cid":"hr-006","name_local":null,"aliases":["Marulianus","Penjacki centar Marulianus","Climbing center Marulianus","PC Marulianus"],"chain":null,"address":"8. mediteranskih igara 2, Poljud stadium, 21000 Split","website":"https://marulianus.hr/","notes":null,"photo":null,"name":"SPK Marulianus climbing centre","state":"SPLITSKO_DALMATINSKA","suburb":"Split","lat":43.5185398,"lng":16.4317824,"coord_source":{"source":"OSM","method":"osm","ref":"node/3073524950"},"coord_precision":"area","types":["indoor-bouldering"],"category":"club","status_claim":"open","bouldering":"yes","evidence":[{"source":"MARUL","url":"http://marulianus.hr/treninzi-za-odrasle/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","open","bouldering"]},{"source":"MARUL","url":"https://marulianus.hr/kontakt/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["address","name"]},{"source":"OSM","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/3073524950","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["location"]}],"research_notes":"Oldest Dalmatian climbing club; its centre has boulder and lead walls and runs adult/kids courses. The OSM node sits about 1.3 km north-west of the Poljud stadium address, so the pin may be stale or wrong: reviewer should check the position. Older directories list a former address at Toncicheva 1/2.","country":"HR"}
{"cid":"hr-007","name_local":null,"aliases":["Tuhobic","SPK Tuhobić","Penjacki klub Tuhobic"],"chain":null,"address":"Zagrebacka 23a, 51000 Rijeka","website":"https://spktuhobic.wordpress.com/","notes":null,"photo":null,"name":"SPK Tuhobic climbing hall","state":"PRIMORJE_GORSKI_KOTAR","suburb":"Rijeka","lat":45.3245137,"lng":14.441857,"coord_source":{"source":"TUHOBIC","method":"official-map","ref":"https://spktuhobic.wordpress.com/ ('show on map' link for Zagrebacka 23a)"},"coord_precision":"building","types":["indoor-bouldering"],"category":"club","status_claim":"unknown","bouldering":"yes","evidence":[{"source":"TUHOBIC","url":"https://spktuhobic.wordpress.com/2021/03/06/otvaramo-boulder-dvoranu/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","bouldering"]},{"source":"TUHOBIC","url":"https://spktuhobic.wordpress.com/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["address","location","name"]},{"source":"NOVILIST","url":"https://www.novilist.hr/rijeka-regija/rijeka/rijeka-dobila-nove-prostore-za-gimnastiku-i-penjanje-po-umjetnoj-stijeni/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","location"]},{"source":"HSPS","url":"https://hsps-climbing.org/dvorane/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","bouldering"]}],"research_notes":"Club with a large boulder wall (opened March 2021 per its site). The club website is stale (latest news 2021), so current opening is unconfirmed. The federation gives Spincicheva 2 as the hall address while the club site and a 2022 news item put the climbing premises at Zagrebacka 23a; pin used is the club site's map link for Zagrebacka 23a. Reviewer should confirm which address is the hall.","country":"HR"}
{"cid":"hr-008","name_local":null,"aliases":["SPK Vertikal","PK Vertikal","Vertikal Varazdin","Vetikal"],"chain":null,"address":"Ulica Dragutina Rakovca 3, 42000 Varazdin","website":"https://pk-vertikal.hr/","notes":null,"photo":null,"name":"SPK Vertikal Varazdin climbing hall","state":"VARAZDIN","suburb":"Varazdin","lat":46.2953898,"lng":16.3328461,"coord_source":{"source":"OSM","method":"osm","ref":"node/14145309133"},"coord_precision":"building","types":["indoor-bouldering"],"category":"club","status_claim":"open","bouldering":"yes","evidence":[{"source":"VERTIKAL","url":"https://pk-vertikal.hr/treninzi/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","open","address"]},{"source":"VERTIKAL","url":"http://pk-vertikal.hr/uvodni-tecaj-boulderinga/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["bouldering"]},{"source":"VERTIKAL","url":"https://pk-vertikal.hr/kontakt/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["address","name"]},{"source":"HSPS","url":"https://hsps-climbing.org/dvorane/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","bouldering"]},{"source":"OSM","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/14145309133","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["location"]}],"research_notes":"Mountaineering/climbing club with a newer hall in the Vindija gymnastics centre plus training slots at Sloboda stadium (Ognjena Price 34). Hall use is for club members only after a few group sessions. The federation lists the street as Rakovca 330, which looks like a typo. OSM node name is misspelled Vetikal.","country":"HR"}
{"cid":"hr-009","name_local":null,"aliases":["Bastion","SPK Bastion","Gradski vrt climbing wall"],"chain":null,"address":"NSD Gradski vrt (teaching sports hall), Osijek","website":null,"notes":null,"photo":null,"name":"SPK Bastion Osijek hall","state":"OSIJEK_BARANJA","suburb":"Osijek","lat":45.5438219,"lng":18.6939904,"coord_source":{"source":"OSM","method":"osm","ref":"node/13598050632"},"coord_precision":"building","types":[],"category":"club","status_claim":"unknown","bouldering":"unknown","evidence":[{"source":"OSIJEKHR","url":"https://www.osijek.hr/umjetna-stijena-za-sportsko-penjanje-dostupna-u-nsd-gradski-vrt/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists","location"]},{"source":"FBBAST","url":"https://www.facebook.com/spkbastionosijek/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["name"]},{"source":"HSPS","url":"https://hsps-climbing.org/dvorane/","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["exists"]},{"source":"OSM","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/13598050632","accessed":"2026-10-01","supports":["location"]}],"research_notes":"City news says a boulder wall (up to about 4 m, with mats) and a lead wall were installed at the Gradski vrt hall for club Bastion and the mountain rescue service; the federation tags it boulder and lead. The club has no own website and its Facebook page is not readable without login, so there is no primary confirmation of bouldering or current opening.","country":"HR"}
